  "caption": "US President Donald Trump is calling for an official investigation into pre election economic growth data after the government revised the figures up to 4.3 percent according to Anadolu.\n\nTrump publicly questioned the accuracy and timing of the economic numbers that were released before the vote.\n\nThe significant revision has sparked intense political debate over the reliability of official economic reporting.\n\nInvestigations into government data releases are rare but can carry major political consequences.\n\nDo you think economic data releases should be independently audited before elections? 👇\n\nFollow Vok for more stories like this.\n#Vok #VokOriginals #USPolitics #DonaldTrump #Economy\n\n📸 CabbageFuel / Wikimedia Commons (CC BY-SA 4.0)",
